SUMMARY:Dinner and Game Night at Bierhall Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Meet People Lancaster\nDinner and game night at Bierhall Brewi
 ng with South Central pa SOLO Singles Group on Saturday Aug 8th! Join us f
 or dinner at 6 with games at 7!\n\nPlease feel free to bring your favorite
  game along!\n\nGame Night @📍Bierhall Brewing\, 1703 New Holland Pike\,
  Lancaster PA 17601\n\nCost: Free to attend\, but please support Bierhall 
 with a drink purchase as a thanks for hosting us and please tip your barte
 nder. Please make sure you settle your tab there before leaving for the ni
 ght.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31563394
 8/
